// Gold set format. One JSON object per line; lines starting with // are ignored.
//
// Ground truth is (filename, page) - never a chunk id. Pages survive re-chunking,
// re-embedding and a change of retriever; chunk ids do not, and labelling by them
// means your first chunk-size sweep silently invalidates the whole dataset.
//
// Categories:
//   exact_term     citations, party names, dates, clause numbers. Dense retrieval
//                  is weakest here, so these are the questions that will justify
//                  adding full-text search.
//   semantic       paraphrased, little lexical overlap with the source.
//   multi_document answering needs evidence from more than one document.
//   clause_absent  the documents do not contain what is asked. No evidence,
//                  excluded from recall and MRR. In the answer phase the right
//                  answer says it is not there, with or without the clause that
//                  rules it out; asserting it, or offering a nearby clause as
//                  the answer, is wrong.
//
// Aim for ~60 questions to start and grow to ~100. Write them by reading real
// pages of your own corpus: open a page, ask what a person would actually come
// looking for, record the page. Questions invented without looking at a page tend
// to reuse its vocabulary, which flatters dense retrieval and hides the gap that
// hybrid search exists to close.

{"id": "q001", "question": "What is the notice period for terminating the agreement?", "category": "semantic", "relevant": [{"filename": "example_lease.pdf", "page": 4}], "note": "Source says 'ninety days written notice'; question avoids that wording on purpose."}
{"id": "q002", "question": "What was the case number in Person A v Southampton Local Authority?", "category": "exact_term", "relevant": [{"filename": "Transcript-of-proceedings-Person-A-v-Southampton-Local-Authority.pdf", "page": 1}]}
{"id": "q003", "question": "Which clause governs late payment, and what does the schedule say the fee is?", "category": "multi_document", "relevant": [{"filename": "example_lease.pdf", "page": 4}, {"filename": "example_lease_schedule.pdf", "page": 2}]}
{"id": "q004", "question": "What is the maximum penalty for breach of contract under Albanian law?", "category": "clause_absent", "relevant": [], "note": "No Albanian statute in the corpus. Correct behaviour is to say it is not there, not a plausible guess."}
